```sql
ALTER TABLE artikel ADD COLUMN carian tsvector
  GENERATED ALWAYS AS (to_tsvector('english', tajuk || ' ' || isi)) STORED;
CREATE INDEX idx_carian ON artikel USING gin (carian);
SELECT tajuk, ts_rank(carian, pertanyaan) AS skor
FROM artikel, to_tsquery('kopi & premium') AS pertanyaan
WHERE carian @@ pertanyaan
ORDER BY skor DESC LIMIT 10;
```
Generated column (sentiasa segar) + GIN + ranking + had. Stemming Inggeris/Melayu asas; kamus tersuai untuk istilah domain. `ts_headline` untuk sorotan.

```sql
CREATE TABLE log_acara (masa timestamptz NOT NULL, data jsonb)
  PARTITION BY RANGE (masa);
CREATE TABLE log_2026_10 PARTITION OF log_acara
  FOR VALUES FROM ('2026-10-01') TO ('2026-11-01');
-- archival: DETACH (segera) → pg_dump → DROP
ALTER TABLE log_acara DETACH PARTITION log_2026_01;
```
Partition baharu dicipta sebelum bulan tiba (cron awal bulan). Pruning disahkan per query (`EXPLAIN` tunjuk partition). Default partition tangkap sesat.

```sql
-- sambungan & kunci menunggu
SELECT count(*), state FROM pg_stat_activity GROUP BY 1;
SELECT * FROM pg_locks WHERE NOT granted;
-- bloat & seq scan
SELECT relname, n_dead_tup, last_vacuum FROM pg_stat_user_tables ORDER BY n_dead_tup DESC LIMIT 5;
SELECT relname, seq_scan, idx_scan FROM pg_stat_user_tables WHERE seq_scan > 1000 AND idx_scan = 0;
-- replikasi lag
SELECT client_addr, pg_wal_lsn_diff(pg_current_wal_lsn(), replay_lsn) AS lag FROM pg_stat_replication;
```
Empat semakan pagi: sambungan, kunci, bloat/imbasan, lag. Amaran automatik pada ambang; mata manusia untuk corak.

```sql
CREATE TABLE audit_log (bila timestamptz DEFAULT now(), siapa text, aksi text, jadual text, lama jsonb, baharu jsonb);
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION audit() RETURNS trigger LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$
BEGIN
  INSERT INTO audit_log(siapa, aksi, jadual, lama, baharu)
  VALUES (current_user, TG_OP, TG_TABLE_NAME, row_to_json(OLD), row_to_json(NEW));
  RETURN COALESCE(NEW, OLD);
END $$;
CREATE TRIGGER audit_pengguna AFTER INSERT OR UPDATE OR DELETE ON pengguna
  FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION audit();
```
Satu fungsi untuk semua jadual audit (JSON fleksibel). `TG_OP/TG_TABLE_NAME` generik. Jadual audit dipartition bulanan (membesar pantas!).
